  Critical Gap: /cmd_vel → PX4 Offboard
                                       
  The local_planner and mission_manager publish geometry_msgs/Twist on /cmd_vel. PX4 ignores this — it only accepts
  offboard commands on:                                                                                                 
   
  - /fmu/in/offboard_control_mode (px4_msgs/OffboardControlMode)                                                        
  - /fmu/in/trajectory_setpoint (px4_msgs/TrajectorySetpoint)
                                                                                                                        
  You need a bridge node that converts /cmd_vel → those two PX4 topics. This is Step 1 before anything else works       
  end-to-end.
                                                                                                                        
