  Step 2 — Add the PX4 Offboard Bridge Node
                                                                                                                        
  Create src/drone_bringup/drone_bringup/px4_vel_bridge.py. This node:
  - Subscribes to /cmd_vel (Twist)                                                                                      
  - Publishes OffboardControlMode at 10 Hz (required heartbeat)
  - Converts linear.x/y/z and angular.z → TrajectorySetpoint in velocity mode                                           
  - Sends /fmu/in/vehicle_command to arm + enable offboard mode on first /mission/start                                 
                                                                                                                        
  Then add it to px4_cave.launch.py alongside the existing bridge nodes. Without this, the mission FSM has no way to    
  actually move the drone.                                                                                              
                                                                                                                        
